<p>Put all of your physical and magical might into one devastating attack.</p><p>Strike all adjacent enemies for <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">122%, 131%, 138%, 144%, 150%</acronym> weapon damage and daze them (using your highest power) for 3 turns.</p><p></p><p>Using this talent consumes all of your Positive Energy and prevents you from generating positive energy for 5 turns.</p><p>Every point of positive energy increases the damage by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">1.00%, 1.34%, 1.59%, 1.81%, 2.00%.</acronym></p><p>Every 15 points of positive energy increase the radius by 1 (up to 10).</p>